pi-context-view 0.4.2 — omp compatibility patch

omp (Oh My Pi) does not implement two pi extension APIs this plugin relies on:
  - ctx.getSystemPromptOptions() is absent (before_agent_start passes undefined)
  - ctx.ui.setWorkingVisible() is absent
Without this patch every turn logs an extension error and /context crashes.
Guard both; measurement degrades gracefully (context files/skills fold into
Base Prompt, silent probe falls back after timeout). Applied idempotently by
scripts/omp-plugins. Regenerate against the pristine npm tarball when the
plugin version changes; drop it once omp implements the APIs upstream.

